               <msContents class="#STM">
                  <summary><p>This manuscript contains the complete text of the commentary, attributed to <persName xml:lang="pi">Buddhaghosa</persName>, to the <title xml:lang="pi">Dhammapada</title>. It includes a table of contents at the beginning.</p>
<p>This manuscript is among a large collection that was given by T. W. Rhys-Davids to the John Rylands Library at the University of Manchester. Although the printed catalogue gives no date, and the online catalogue record states that it is <q>undated</q>, there is a <term xml:lang="sa">Śaka</term> era date at the end of the manuscript.</p>Korzybski </summary>
                  
               <msItem defective="false"><title xml:lang="pi">Dhammapadaṭṭhakathā</title><author xml:lang="pi">Buddhaghosa</author><textLang mainLang="pli"/><rubric xml:lang="pi"><pb n="1v" facs="7"/>
<lb n="1"/>namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa ෴</rubric><incipit xml:lang="pi"><pb n="1v" facs="7"/>
